url: "https://github.com/REPLACE-WITH-GITHUB-USERNAME/ITiCSE2026_Teamwork_Skills-Values-Virtues"
abstract: >-
  Materials, data, and tools produced by ITiCSE 2026 Working Group 10 (WG10),
  examining how tertiary computing programs can effectively integrate
  teamwork instruction, with a focus on the skills, values, and virtues
  students need throughout collaborative projects. Includes a systematic
  literature review of teamwork in computing and engineering education,
  screening and data-extraction tables, and the tooling used to run the
  review.
keywords:
  - computing education
  - teamwork
